## Credential references (names only, never values)
- IC read-only token: `op://<vault>/<item>/<field>`
- Market data key (Massive): `op://Automation/Investing Companion - Secrets/MASSIVE_API_KEY`
  Resolve it into the environment before starting Claude Code; `.mcp.json` reads
  `MASSIVE_API_KEY` from there. Example (document only, run it yourself):
  `export MASSIVE_API_KEY="$(~/.claude/scripts/op-resolve.py 'op://Automation/Investing Companion - Secrets/MASSIVE_API_KEY')"`
  One-time server install (per Massive's docs): `uv tool install "mcp_massive @ git+https://github.com/massive-com/mcp_massive@v0.10.0"`

## Endpoints
- IC base URL: `http://<ic-host>:8000`

